config ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_TYPING_SUPPRESS
    bool "Typing Suppress Input Processor"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_POINTING
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_TYPING_SUPPRESS_ENABLED
    help
      Drops pointing-device events for require-prior-idle-ms after the
      last key press, preventing accidental cursor movement while typing.
